        "original_id": "84e17b0a-7e30-57d5-8a02-091d15dcc412",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daryl Hall, John Oates\n- Music Groups: Hall & Oates\n- Products: Bigger Than Both of Us, Rich Girl\n- Places: Philadelphia\n- Topics: studio albums, Billboard Hot 100\n\nFacts:\n- Daryl Hall and John Oates, often referred to as Hall & Oates, are an American musical duo from Philadelphia.\n- Bigger Than Both of Us is the fifth studio album by American pop duo Hall & Oates, and it was released in August 1976.\n- Bigger Than Both of Us included \"Rich Girl,\" which became the first of Hall & Oates's six number-one singles on the Billboard Hot 100.",
